{"author":{"id":"dec876858d28babbadcead4137861bf586626b8518cbce9c5f4fc52ac3b424b8"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1794445496,"nonce":"DrobrGdeTsbMYYfGnoCzjYm4C5Q=","title":"Fast frames leave the label of a bound container where the last full paint put it","message":"Found by the animation-path harness (crates/blinc_recorder/tests/animation_paths.rs, scene \"motion translate\" and its scale and rotate siblings), once the harness drove its values as a window does: a spring target set each frame, so the value is away from its target while it moves. Written with `set_immediate` the compositor sees nothing animating, and every \"patched\" frame had been a full paint.\n\nA card with a text label under `.motion().translate_x(..)`. The first fast attempt is rejected (`apply_binding_deltas` returns false: cross-stream groups in the dynamic batch) and repaints in full. After that paint, `motion_output_promoted()` is true, so on every later frame the compositor skips `apply_binding_deltas` and presents the cache with the promoted layers blitted at the live binding values. The box moves. The label comes from `cached_motion_subtree_text_prims`, which a full paint fills and nothing re-places for a binding (`motion_subtree_text_patch` exists for CSS animations only). It stays where the full paint put it.\n\nAgainst a full paint of the same frame, 11 of the 12 steps differ: 600 to 1350 px, channel difference over 200, translate worst. The same scenes without a label match to within 13 levels. Contact sheet: BLINC_ANIM_PATHS_OUT=\u003cdir\u003e.\n\nThe windowed runner decides `try_fast_paint` from did_rebuild, relayout, CSS, scroll, bounds animations and overlays; none of them is set by a bound spring, so a window should take the same path. Not run in a window yet: confirm there before fixing. If it holds, every `.motion()` binding over text freezes the text on fast frames.\n\nThe harness lists the scenes in KNOWN_DIFFERENT; one that stops differing fails the test until it is taken off.\n\nRelated: 40fc670 (bound rotation did not turn text), 122c606 (node table).","files":null}]}